        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Julian Marley\n- Organizations: Lightyear Entertainment\n- Products: A Time & Place\n- Concepts: Rastafari, spirituality\n- Topics: reggae, new religious movements\n\nFacts:\n- Rastafari developed in Jamaica during the 1930s and is classified as a new religious movement.\n- Julian Marley is a devout Rastafarian who follows in his father’s footsteps and uses his music to inspire his life and spirituality.\n- A Time & Place is the second studio album by reggae artist Julian Marley and was released in 2003 on Lightyear Entertainment.",
